        "prompt": "Ask my claude-docs notebook: What does the setup guide say about browser connection steps?"
      },
      {
        "title": "Add a notebook",
        "scenario": "Registry setup",
        "prompt": "Add this NotebookLM URL and discover its title, topics, and document names: https://notebooklm.google.com/notebook/..."
